Where to place the snippets in TennisGame.html:
- CSS: Insert the first snippet inside the <head> section, before </head>. (Approx. before the last line of </head> — note actual line numbers depend on your file.)
- HTML: Insert the second snippet immediately after the opening <body> tag, before your game canvas/elements.
- JavaScript: Insert the third snippet just before the closing </body> tag, after your game scripts so we can call into your game if available.

Note: This uses localStorage/sessionStorage for demo authentication (no backend). After a successful sign in, the overlay hides and we call an existing startGame()/initGame() function if found, and also dispatch a frontpage:authenticated event you can listen for in your game code if needed.

