- CI/CD outline
  - Build: npm ci && npm run build; docker build -t your-registry/lookup-service:${GIT_SHA} .
  - Scan: run image and dependency scanners.
  - Push: docker push your-registry/lookup-service:${GIT_SHA} and :latest or :semver.
