//  - Compute descriptor ID = H("hsdir" | blinded-key | secret-id-part)
//  - Map to HSDir ring
// Here, we demonstrate fetching via Tor's Onionoo-style or rds endpoints if available; fallback to a public helper.

static bool FetchHSDescriptorViaHelper(const std::string& onion, std::string& descOut){
    // WARNING: This uses a public helper gateway to fetch the descriptor and is not privacy-preserving.
    // It is provided solely to demonstrate WinHTTP networking and descriptor parsing.
